Package: citronics-lime-fp2
Version: 2.7
Architecture: armhf
Maintainer: Citronics <info@citronics.eu>
Depends: linux-image-citronics-lime-fp2, linux-firmware-lime-fp2, citronics-initramfs, unudhcpd, limeboard-io, limeboard-ha, unattended-upgrades, citronics-net-id (>= 1.3)
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Citronics Lime meta-package for Fairphone 2
 Installs the complete Citronics Lime software stack for Fairphone 2:
 firmware, initramfs, DHCP helper, and the Limeboard header tools and
 Home Assistant agent.
